UID:260514q8K8aO5JJ0SsGLC9CjbApQ
DESCRIPTION:It's a StorySlam! In fact\, the longest running Slam in Northe
 rn California-17 years! We do 5 minute\, True Stories\, Told Live\, On Sta
 ge\, Without Notes\, Based on the Month's Theme! Come drop your name in th
 e hat to tell or just come and enjoy tales from your neighbors! At the end
  of the show the entire audience can vote for their favorite. That person 
 receives a $50 dollar cash prize\, their story & picture in The Argus Cour
 ier and an invite to our year end GrandSlam on the big stage of The Mystic
  Theater! We've been waiting for you for 17 years-come check it out! What 
 are you waiting for?
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2051036158959072/?acontext=%7B%22event
