DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T193000
UID:260504kMs14CR-_ECrT7ZhH-TcCA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Pour + Explore: Four Valleys wine tasting hosted a
 t the picturesque Paradise Ridge Winery on Thursday\, May 21\, from 5:30
 –7:30 PM—an unforgettable setting known for its sweeping vineyard view
 s and refined wine country ambiance. This wine tasting event highlights wi
 nes from four distinctive Sonoma County appellations—Alexander Valley\, 
 Dry Creek Valley\, Knights Valley\, and Russian River Valley—offering a 
 unique opportunity to compare styles\, explore different growing regions\,
  and discover new favorites all in one place. Presented by Sonoma County V
 intners in collaboration with Sommelier Christopher Sawyer\, this thoughtf
 ully curated tasting brings together 30+ wineries for an evening that cele
 brates the depth and diversity of Sonoma County wine.
LOCATION:Paradise Ridge Winery
URL:https://sonomawine.com/pour-explore-four-valleys-may-21-2026/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
