 lations\, and Media Manager\n\n             \\(t\\) 941.704.85
 72 Ext 216           leahhryniewicki@cirqueitalia.com\n\n2026 Pr
 ess Release – Paranormal I - VOODOO \\(BLACK UNIT\\)\n\nCirque Italia is
  now presenting:\n\n“PARANORMAL CIRQUE!”\n\nONE OF THE BEST THRILLING 
 EXPERIENCES!!!\n\nComing to Santa Rosa\, CA from May 22nd – 25th!\n\nAre
  you ready Santa Rosa? Do you love thrilling\, wicked\, sexy\, or even dan
 gerous things? Paranormal Cirque will expose you to a unique creation of c
 ombined theatre\, circus\, and cabaret with a new European style flare. Ci
 rque Italia is now presenting a brand-new show for a MATURE audience! \n\
 nThis innovative horror story features different shades of sexy and an inc
 omparable storyline - the only thing you can be sure of during this unique
  experience is that you will not know what to expect!  It might be hard t
 o divide reality and illusion!\n\n Are you intrigued yet? Dare to let you
 rself get wicked for one night under our Big TOP and live on the edge with
  Paranormal Cirque show! You will fall into a parallel world and end up su
 rrounded by monstrous creatures with hidden talents that will amaze you wi
 th the circus arts. This show is NOT for the faint of heart. You may have 
 to catch your breath or try to stop your heart from racing during this adr
 enaline filled performance. \n\nA careful casting selection has united th
 e best artists from all over the world. A few of the circus arts you can e
 xpect to see in this new production include the jaw-dropping Wheel of Deat
 h\, mystifying MAGIC\, and more. Our Black unit also follows our strict an
 imal-free policy.\n\nFor more information visit www.paranormalcirque.com a
 nd make sure to check all our social media accounts. Tickets can be purcha
 sed now starting at $10.00 depending on availability. Restricted – under
