 merchandise\n\nThe main show runs from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM\, followed by a
  special Trading Night from 5:00 PM to 9:00 PM where collectors can buy\, 
 sell\, trade\, and connect with fellow hobby enthusiasts.\n\nShow Hours: 1
 0:00 AM – 9:00 PM Main Vendor Show: 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM Trading Night: 
 5:00 PM – 9:00 PM\n\nAdmission: $5 for visitors\n\nVendors Wanted! Vendo
 r tables are available for $100 per table.\n\nFor more information or to r
