 titian\, cookbook author\, and culinary educator with over 15 years of exp
 erience. You’ll create your own vegetable ferment to take home while gai
 ning the skills to replicate the process with confidence.\n\nExplore the s
 cience behind fermentation\, work with naturally occurring microbes\, and 
 discover why making your own fermented foods can be more beneficial than s
 tore-bought options. All materials and handouts are provided\, and it’s 
 great fun\, too.
