BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Not Loud Concerts Presents… Summer Sessions at Napa Yard
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T210000
UID:260519jU8Yh-k3s02DOH3eE1R-XA
DESCRIPTION:The Not Loud Concert folks are putting on 3 unique summer musi
 c festivals in Napa called Summer Sessions. The organizer of the event wou
 ld love to do an interview. Would it be possible to do an interview or an 
 article about what makes these summer music festivals unique?\n\nThese fes
 tivals are designed to be comfortable for both the musicians and the audie
 nce. Not Loud Concerts is attempting to break down all the bad stereotypes
  of music festivals. \n\nThey are called Summer Sessions and will be held
  at Napa Yard in Napa. Two bands will be on stage at the same time dueling
  it out and trading songs. \n\nThese music festivals will be from 7 - 9 p
 m\n\nBeer\, craft cocktails and BBQ will be available for purchase. \n\nE
 ach summer session has a different theme. \n\nJune 7 - Vintage Rock Night
  \n\nJuly 19 - Blues Night\n\nAug 16 - Country Boogie Night\n\nThis festi
 val is brought to you by Not Loud Concerts\, an organization that makes co
 ncerts a relaxing and fun experience by being “Not too long\, Not too ex
 pensive\, and Not too Loud.”
LOCATION:Napa Yard
URL:https://www.notloudconcerts.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
