 unds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**Stella Heath** Stella Heath\
 , delivers a wild\, high-spirited fusion of French Gypsy Jazz\, New Orlean
 s swing\, global folk\, and traditionals. \n\n**Details**\n\nNo cover. Wa
 lk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recom
 mend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
