DESCRIPTION:JOIN US ON MEMORIAL DAY WEEKEND FOR ONE OF MARIN COUNTY'S MOST
  BELOVED EVENTS.\n\nDANCE - to the music of the Kymata Band all weekend\n\
 nENJOY - Greek Wines\, and Greek Delicacies\n\nLISTEN - to renowned speake
