BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:In A Landscape - Classical Music with Hunter Noack in the Wild
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T183000
UID:2512128TKHi5I1F0uaOCP4AwrKPw
DESCRIPTION:Founded in 2016 by classical pianist Hunter Noack\, IN A LANDS
 CAPE: Classical Music in the Wild is a 501\\(c\\)\\(3\\) nonprofit outdoor
  concert series where America's most stunning landscapes replace the tradi
 tional concert hall. A 9-foot Steinway grand piano travels on a flatbed tr
 ailer to State and National Parks\, urban greenspaces\, working ranches\, 
 farms\, and historical sites for classical music concerts that connect peo
 ple with each landscape. To meet the acoustical challenges of performing i
 n the wild\, music is transmitted to concert-goers via wireless headphones
 . No longer confined to seats\, audiences explore the landscape\, wander t
 hrough secret glens\, lie in sunny meadows\, and roam old growth forests. 
 IN A LANDSCAPE has presented 275 concerts in Oregon\, Washington\, Montana
 \, Idaho\, New York\, Utah\, Wyoming\, and California to over 55\,000 peop
 le. Folks travel from near and far. Local ranchers\, loggers\, and farmers
  gather with visiting city dwellers and tourists from beyond.
LOCATION:Campovida
URL:https://www.campovida.com/upcoming-events/campcampovida-zhl7c-56ma4
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
