BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seeds of Change - Farm Dinner & Intern Showcase
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260527T193000
UID:260519jopt9ndKwUybD7m_M9G8AQ
DESCRIPTION:**Seeds of Change - Farm Dinner & Intern Showcase** *Wednesda
 y\, May 27 · 6–7:30pm · Fern Homestead\, Penngrove · $40/person*\n\nJ
 oin us for an evening on the farm with a Sonoma County–sourced dinner an
 d the chance to meet REA's incredible interns. Hear their stories\, walk t
 he farm\, and connect with others who care about the future of food and fa
 rming in our community.\n\nOn the menu: gourmet grilled cheese\, farm fres
 h salad\, vegetable frittata\, strawberries & cream\, and nonalcoholic bev
 erages. All sourced from local farms.\n\n**Get your tickets at regenerativ
 eeducationalliance.org** - limited seating so don't wait!\n\n**Seeds of C
 hange - Online Auction Open Now!** https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/
 seeds-of-change-online-auction\n\nOur online auction features a curated co
 llection of local experiences and goods donated by Sonoma County makers\, 
 farms\, and businesses - from a private tour of Fern Homestead to a farmho
 use cheesemaking class to one-of-a-kind Petaluma gift baskets. Every bid g
 oes directly toward funding REA's programs in the coming year. \n\n**Brow
 se and place your bids here** - More items will be added so check back fr
 equently and start bidding today!\n\nWhether you join us around the table\
 , place a winning bid\, or do both\, your support helps REA grow hands-on 
 learning in agroecology and nurture the next generation of environmental s
 tewards right here at home. Thank you for being part of this.
LOCATION:Fern Homestead
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/seeds-of-change-farm-di
 nner-intern-showcase/18928518/2026-05-27T18
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
