UID:2605089R8b8yQMz0Sy8v7RzrXifQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a day dedicated to supportive services\, health\, 
 and wellness for older adults and their caretakers. Discover over 20  hea
 lth and wellness providers offering invaluable resources.\n\nThe Up Valley
  Family Centers invites older adults and/or their caretakers to our annual
  Older Adult Health and Wellness Fair held in Pioneer Park in Calistoga. T
 he fair is scheduled for Wednesday\, May 27th from 10 am to 12 pm. The eve
 nt is focused on bringing information about older adult services in the co
 unty UpValley. \n\nWe will have Napa County’s Be Well Mobile Services V
 ehicle available for community members to access services such as Medi-Cal
  and CalFresh\, and 20+ partner organizations will provide important welln
 ess information and resources.  Come learn about community support for yo
 u and your loved ones.\n\nNo registration required.  There is no fee to a
 ttend. \n\nFor more information\, please contact: Emma Diamond\, Senior S
 ervices Case Manager (707) 965-5010 ext. 307 or ediamond@upvalleyfamilycen
 ters.org
LOCATION:Pioneer Park
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/older-adult-health-and-
 wellness-fair/18789371/2026-05-27T10
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
