 rs during dedicated signing windows. Browse their work\, ask questions\, a
 nd connect directly.**\n\n**✧ Author Lineup Schedule** **TBA**\n\n**✧ 
 Curated Vendors** **Explore a selection of book-focused vendors offering c
 andles\, jewelry\, literary gifts\, and more.**\n\n**✧ Interactive Exper
 iences** **Participate in hands-on elements throughout the evening\, inclu
 ding live book foiling.**\n\n**✧ Drinks & Treats** **Additional themed d
 rinks and treats will be available.**\n\n**✧ Event Details ✧**\n\n**
 📍 Hall of the Above** **199 Petaluma Blvd N** **Petaluma\, CA 94952**\n
 \n**🗓 May 28\, 2026** **🕯 4:00 PM – 10:00 PM**\n\n**🎟 $55 per p
 erson** **21+ event**\n\n**✧ Attire ✧**\n\n**Guests are encouraged to 
 come dressed in a way that reflects their personal style—romantic\, bold
 \, or otherwise.**
