  use the code earlybird18 at checkout. Offer ends May 24th.\n\nPromo C
 odes are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitive\, b
 ut must be typed as one word.\n\nOff the Perch is a dynamic trio that ble
 nds contemporary song writing with the heartbeat of folk tradition. \n\nA
 t its core\, the group weaves acoustic instruments into rich\, living text
 ures that evolve into electric soundscapes\, evoking the California North 
 Bay’s vast expanse of forest\, field\, and sea.\n\nTheir music rises fro
 m the earth yet reaches for the unknown — rooted in craft\, lifted by lu
 sh harmonies\, and driven by original compositions offered by each member.
  \n\nWith every performance\, Off the Perch invites listeners into a spac
 e where time bends\, the duality of beauty and pain intertwine\, and where
  the shared pulse of the human experience becomes a transcendent celebrati
 on. \n\nSloan Irving is a 23 year old singer songwriter from Petaluma. S
 he pulls inspiration from many genres such as  americana\, soul\, and ind
 ie rock while leaning heavily into her love of simple but haunting folk me
 lodies and her desire to capture many sides of the human experience throug
 h her storytelling.\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/sloan.irving\n\nhttps://ww
 w.instagram.com/sloanirving\n\nhttps://youtube.com/channel/UCdoDaLRShGCwVO
 C8RIfTnTw\n\nhttps://open.spotify.com/artist/6Rd1Be5cGWYGDe6a5aeW8i
LOCATION:The Lost Church
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket#/instances/a0FUh0
 00007kxp3MAA
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wine Tails Trail at Cuvaison Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260529T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260529T170000
UID:260508zCLM3c5yDEuJnnlDUxsONg
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a new way to experience Cuvaison with your canine compan
 ion on the Wine Tails Trail. This self-guided vineyard walk winds just und
 er a mile through our Los Carneros estate\, with QR code stops highlightin
 g the history of our vines and winemaking. Guests begin their adventure by
  checking in with our Concierge for a map and orientation before setting o
 ff on the trail.\n\nAfter the walk\, return to the estate and enjoy a seat
 ed tasting of our current release wines\, while your pup relaxes by your s
 ide and enjoys a selection of “Barkuterie.” The Wine Tails Trail is a 
 chance to stretch your legs\, explore the vineyard\, and savor Cuvaison in
  the company of your best friend.\n\nWhen booking this experience\, please
  plan for the dog walk to begin at the time you select. The walk itself av
 erages about 45 minutes\, though you’ll also check in with our Concierge
  before and after\, as well as complete a quick waiver at the start. Your 
 wine tasting will be scheduled 60 minutes after your selected walk time\, 
 allowing a smooth transition from the trail back to your seated experience
 .\n\nGroup Size: Up to 4 guests\, including non-tasters\n\nDuration: Pleas
 e allow 120 minutes for this experience
LOCATION:Cuvaison Experience Salon\, Outdoors Only
URL:https://tewines.com/pages/cuvaison-tastings 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
