BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Stand-up + Improv = STANDPROV | Downtown Santa Rosa Good Times
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T220000
UID:260404SR9mDlDb002Yvg0GzGjYgw
DESCRIPTION:oin us in celebrating four years of StandProv! Equal parts sta
 ndup and improvisational comedy!\n\nStand-up + Improv = STANDPROV | Downto
 wn Santa Rosa Good Time\n\nJoin us in celebrating four years of StandProv 
 ! Equal parts standup and improvisational comedy\, StandProv hits an anniv
 ersary of electrifying audiences who enjoy spontaneous acts of comedic re-
 interpretation\, on May 25th.\n\nThe StandProv cocktail mixes stand-up com
 edy and improv\, sourced from the best of Northern California comedians an
 d improvisers. StandProv frankensteins together the best parts of standup 
 and improv comedy. Standup comedians perform their most time-tested bits\,
  which then become the inspiration for a cast of improvisers to build out 
 characters\, scenes\, and premises. Pairing non-stop entertainment with go
 od vibes distills the balanced portmanteau commonly referred to in layman'
 s terms as StandProv .\n\nFeaturing premier Bay Area comedians and improvi
 sers\, StandProv offers a uniquely familiar performance experience to fans
  of standup\, improv\, and experimental art-form fusions alike!\n\nMay's p
 erformers include: -Melissa Christine -Brendan Caskey -Chels Meyer -Josh J
 obrack -Katie Lindsey -Rachel Pyle Hosted By: Franco Tevini\n\nA talented 
 standup comedian and host of StandProv \, Franco performs digestible bits 
 of surreal\, elevated slice-of-life comedy.\n\nJeremy Lessnau\n\nA Sonoma 
 county based improvisational comedian/musician\, who co-hosts StandProv as
  equal parts passion-project and court-ordered community service. If you w
 ant to be part of an off-the-wall live anniversary experience—one that i
 s sure to be a memorable night of gut-busting laughter—grab a seat for S
 tandProv at Barrel Proof Lounge in downtown Santa Rosa\, Saturday\, May 30
 th!\n\nVIP TABLES NOW AVAILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating
 \, your own private call button to summon service\, and your first round o
 f drinks (or a bottle of wine) for only $95!\n\n21+ Doors @7/Show @8 $15ad
 v / $20door\n\n"Equal parts standup and improvisational comedy\, StandProv
  electrifies audiences who enjoy a laugh of any kind"\n\nCheck out **www.
 BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/stand-up-improv-standprov-downtown-santa-
 rosa-good-times-tickets-1986559856006?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Emergence - Spring Through the Eyes of the Artists
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T160000
UID:2604010DCWLyVCLkegu2TBnJztBg
DESCRIPTION:"Emergence" brings together the Artists of Fulton Crossing to 
 explore what Spring means to their creative lives. Spring is more than a s
 eason. It's a metaphor. It's renewal\, risk\, color\, thawing\, blooming\,
  awakening\, and sometimes even struggles. The public is invited to enjoy 
 this free Art exhibit and to take time to wander through the artists studi
 os and gallery spaces. Meet the artists at our opening reception March 21s
 t. Upcoming Art Workshops: March 21: Painting Easter Cookies. April 18: Ci
 gar Box Collage. May 16: Succulent Garden Centerpiece. Make treasures to b
 ring home. All ages welcome. Materials provided. E-mail Brenda at nanaspre
 ttypaper@outlook.com for preregistration and workshop info.
