 no for return of the Wood & Glory Antique & Classic Boat and Car Show. Thi
 s fan-favorite event brings together beautifully restored classics\, vinta
 ge charm\, and lakeside fun for a full day the whole family can enjoy. Str
 oll the marina and casino grounds while admiring an incredible display of 
 antique and classic wood boats\, custom and classic cars\, and vintage tra
 ilers. Enjoy delicious eats from local\\*food trucks and vendors\, grab a 
 drink at the marina bar\, and take in live music by the Tattooed Cherries 
 and the scenic shoreline of Clear Lake.  Fundraiser Pancake Feed Start you
 r morning at the marina with our Fundraiser Pancake Feed from 8AM – 11AM
 \, benefiting Operation Tango Mike. Come early\, enjoy breakfast\, and sta
 y for a day filled with nostalgia\, community\, and classic craftsmanship.
