BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Renew: A Sustainable Culinary Celebration for Sonoma Valley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T180000
UID:260403q7wB5TQPAEO7TRQcRW32uw
DESCRIPTION:Renew: A Sustainable Culinary Celebration is a spring fundrai
 ser supporting Sonoma Family Meal’s work at Unity Kitchen. Join us for a
  relaxed evening featuring creative\, globally inspired bites made from up
 cycled ingredients—prepared by our teen culinary program students in col
 laboration with local chefs—alongside favorites from our Sabor food truc
 k.\n\nEnjoy local wine and beer\, live music\, lawn games\, and an excitin
 g raffle\, while learning how we’re reducing food waste\, training the n
 ext generation\, and addressing food insecurity across Sonoma Valley.\n\nC
 ome connect\, celebrate\, and help sustain and grow this work.
LOCATION:Harrows Barn at Cornerstone
URL:http://www.sonomafamilymeal.org/renewevent
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Emergence - Spring Through the Eyes of the Artists
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T160000
UID:260401y2OFjkGUiE2ZoVkkhsjmNg
DESCRIPTION:"Emergence" brings together the Artists of Fulton Crossing to 
 explore what Spring means to their creative lives. Spring is more than a s
 eason. It's a metaphor. It's renewal\, risk\, color\, thawing\, blooming\,
  awakening\, and sometimes even struggles. The public is invited to enjoy 
 this free Art exhibit and to take time to wander through the artists studi
 os and gallery spaces. Meet the artists at our opening reception March 21s
 t. Upcoming Art Workshops: March 21: Painting Easter Cookies. April 18: Ci
 gar Box Collage. May 16: Succulent Garden Centerpiece. Make treasures to b
 ring home. All ages welcome. Materials provided. E-mail Brenda at nanaspre
 ttypaper@outlook.com for preregistration and workshop info.
LOCATION:Fulton Crossing art gallery
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/emergence-spring-through-the-eyes-of-
 the-artists/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
