 sic book publisher Chuck Sher presents a rotating ensemble of professional
 \, veteran jazz musicians in Putnam Plaza Park\, right next to the Speakea
 sy. In partnership with Music in Place\, Jamey Aebersold Jazz Books\, JamB
 ar\, and MadCap Labs\, this event started in 2020 and has since become a s
 taple for locals and visitors alike. Stop by and enjoy some of the best ja
 zz the Bay Area has to offer!
LOCATION:Putnam Plaza Park
URL:https://www.facebook.com/jazzintheplazapetaluma
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
