BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salsa Intermediate with Steven Khuong (6 Weeks)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260603T191500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260603T201500
UID:260511r64-KIEPo0yViv146L7BuA
DESCRIPTION:June 3 – July 8 \\( 6 weeks\\)\n\n7:15 PM – 8:15 PM 4140 R
 edwood Highway \\#8\, San Rafael\, CA\n\nReady to take your salsa to the n
 ext level? This 6-week salsa intermediate Marin series is designed for dan
 cers who already know the basics \\(timing\, basic steps\, and simple turn
 s\, etc.\\) and want to build the confidence and versatility to shine on t
 he social dance floor.\n\nIn this class\, you’ll:\n\nDevelop adaptabilit
 y so you can flow with different partners and music.\n\nRefine your footwo
 rk and styling for sharper expression.\n\nMaster more complex turn pattern
 s and combinations.\n\nStrengthen your lead and follow for smoother\, more
  connected dancing.\n\nWhat to Expect: Steven’s teaching style blends st
 ructure with fun\, creating a supportive space where you’ll be challenge
 d but never overwhelmed. Each week builds on the last\, helping you progre
 ss steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n\nDetails:\n
 \nNo partner necessary — rotations ensure everyone gets to dance.\n\nPle
 ase wear non-marking shoe soles to protect the floor.\n\nArrive 10 minut
 es early to warm up and get settled.\n\nDate & Time: Wednesdays @ 7:15PM 
 – 8:15PM\n\nInstructor: Steven Khuong\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \
 \#8 San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/intermediate-salsa-wednesday-715-pm/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wine Tails Trail at Cuvaison Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260603T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260603T170000
UID:260508PKPAaVnGs0WvXR5BcPAGLw
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a new way to experience Cuvaison with your canine compan
 ion on the Wine Tails Trail. This self-guided vineyard walk winds just und
 er a mile through our Los Carneros estate\, with QR code stops highlightin
 g the history of our vines and winemaking. Guests begin their adventure by
  checking in with our Concierge for a map and orientation before setting o
 ff on the trail.\n\nAfter the walk\, return to the estate and enjoy a seat
 ed tasting of our current release wines\, while your pup relaxes by your s
 ide and enjoys a selection of “Barkuterie.” The Wine Tails Trail is a 
 chance to stretch your legs\, explore the vineyard\, and savor Cuvaison in
  the company of your best friend.\n\nWhen booking this experience\, please
  plan for the dog walk to begin at the time you select. The walk itself av
 erages about 45 minutes\, though you’ll also check in with our Concierge
  before and after\, as well as complete a quick waiver at the start. Your 
 wine tasting will be scheduled 60 minutes after your selected walk time\, 
 allowing a smooth transition from the trail back to your seated experience
 .\n\nGroup Size: Up to 4 guests\, including non-tasters\n\nDuration: Pleas
 e allow 120 minutes for this experience
LOCATION:Cuvaison Experience Salon\, Outdoors Only
URL:https://tewines.com/pages/cuvaison-tastings 
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
