DESCRIPTION:Cuban Salsa Class with Eric Celestino & Abigail Celestino\n\n4
 week class\n\nJune 4 – June 25\n\nThis is a beginner cuban salsa—you w
 ill learn your basic footwork and turns.\n\nIn this class\, you will learn
  the fundamentals of Cuban Salsa\, including body movement\, rhythm\, musi
 cality\, footwork\, partner connection\, and partnerwork patterns inspired
  by authentic Cuban dance culture. We focus on proper technique\, coordina
 tion\, flow\, and natural body expression\, while also building confidence
  and strong foundations.\n\nClasses are structured with:\n\n• Warm-up an
 d body movement\n\n• Footwork and rhythm exercises\n\n• Partnerwork te
 chnique\n\n• Short combinations and practical applications\n\nOur goal i
 s to help you understand how to dance salsa\, not just memorize steps — 
 developing timing\, connection\, and a comfortable\, joyful way of dancing
 .\n\nCome dance with us\, grow your technique\, and experience the energy 
 and flavor of Cuba in a supportive and welcoming environment.\n\nBook your
  spot\n\nDate & Time:\n\n4week class\, June 4 – June 25\n\nThursdays @ 7
 :30 PM\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arri
 ve 10 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allowed.
