 w will have chairs provided SECRET COMEDIANS All comedians remain unknown 
 until they take the stage. Every lineup is carefully curated to include th
 e very best local and nationally touring talent. You may discover your nex
 t favorite comedian or see a familiar face. You'll never know who might sh
 ow up! UNIQUE LIVE EXPERIENCE Our shows are run by a local team of comedy 
 lovers\, and comedians who are passionate about creating a fun and relaxed
