DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\n\nDoors at 7:30pm. \n\nShow from 8:15-1
 0:30pm with one intermission\n\nJoshua James Jackson has just moved back 
 to Sonoma County after a ceremonial decade of life in the East Bay. He wri
 tes pretty dang good songs you probably haven't heard\, and since he's spe
 nt the bulk of his life onstage playing music\, his show is pretty good to
 o. His tunes are either heartbreakers or lovemakers depending on the day. 
 Come on down and welcome this man home.\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/joshu
 ajamesjackson https://www.facebook.com/joshuajamesjacksonmusic https://www
 .joshuajamesjackson.com Elena Lambertson is a singer\, songwriter\, and g
 uitarist who lives in Sonoma County. Inspired by the rural beauty of her h
 ometown\, she plays a medley of heartfelt originals blended with her favor
 ite folk\, bluegrass\, and country music.  https://www.elenalambertson.co
 m/ http://instagram.com/elenalambertson https://www.facebook.com/ElenaLamb
 ertsonMusic/ All proceeds from this show will go directly to local artists
  who will use the funds to continue to survive\, write and pay rent in Son
 oma County.
LOCATION:The Lost Church
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket#/instances/a0FUh0
 00008lE80MAE
