 ing visionaries\, taste some of the world’s greatest wines and stake you
 r claim in something truly special before anyone else. With more than 100
  vintner offerings available\, the Napa Valley Barrel Auction is a truly s
 howstopping experience that defies comparison.\n\nIn an atmosphere charged
  with energy\, ambition and passion for the classically exceptional 2024 N
 apa Valley vintage. Here you are not just a spectator… you are instrumen
 tal in delivering measurable impact with each bid you place.\n\nNapa Valle
 y’s grandest community celebration takes place at the newly reimagined R
 obert Mondavi Winery where culinary delights hide around every corner and 
 the who’s who of Napa Valley brings their best.
LOCATION:Robert Mondavi Winery
