UID:260302qsrSdw1ktkS4w5jlIPOHtw
DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\nFea
 turing Used Goods & Casa Nostra Wood-Fired Pizza\n\nJoin us for a relaxed 
 and lively Friday night at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, locate
 d in downtown Healdsburg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and
  handcrafted food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the feel-good\, cro
 wd-friendly sounds of Used Goods with delicious wood-fired pizzas from Cas
 a Nostra.\n\nUsed Goods brings an upbeat mix of familiar favorites and eas
 ygoing grooves\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a social evening surr
 ounded by barrels and warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines by t
 he glass or bottle while Casa Nostra serves their signature wood-fired piz
 zas\, made fresh on site with quality ingredients.\n\nFriday | 5:00 PM –
  7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 event inside the Ba
 rrel Room. Under-21 guests and leashed pets are welcome on the patio only.
 \n\nCome grab a seat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma County night of grea
 t music\, great wine\, and great food.\n\nWine available for purchase Live
  music by Used Goods Food by Casa Nostra Wood-Fired Pizza Location: Longbo
 ard Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
LOCATION:Longboard VIneyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
