 se \\(near Guerneville\\)\, surrounded by those epic redwoods 🌲🌲 Nat
 ure’s VIP section.\n\n💸 Cover:\n\nJust $15 for full pool access 🏊
 ‍♂️🩱\n\nWanna dance but not dip? Lawn access & DJ vibes are FREE 
