DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260607T170000
UID:260430Sa4EAkz11kOjLibmWrN4mQ
DESCRIPTION:Sing Napa Valley Presents: COUNTRY CHORALE - A Choral Celebrat
 ion of Country Music\n\nGet ready for rich harmonies\, heartfelt storytell
 ing\, and “toes-tappin’” fun! Sing Napa Valley community choir invit
 es you to Country Chorale\, a lively and contemporary choral concert celeb
 rating the uniquely American tradition of country music.\n\nFrom Dolly Par
 ton and John Denver to Brandi Carlile\, Gram Parsons\, and The Chicks\, th
 is program features beloved country classics reimagined through glorious c
 horal harmony—performed by women’s\, men’s\, and mixed ensembles\, p
 lus our full choir. Whether you’re a lifelong country fan or just love g
 reat choral music\, Country Chorale offers something for everyone. Come en
 joy a fresh\, sophisticated take on a genre full of heart\, soul\, and har
 mony!\n\n📅 Sunday\, June 7\, 2026 🕒 3:00 p.m.\n\n📍 First Presbyte
 rian Church Gymnasium\,\n\n1333 Third Street\, downtown Napa \\(across fro
 m the Uptown Theatre\\)\n\n🎟 Tickets: $25 General Admission $10 Student
 s\n\n👉 Grab your tickets and join us for an afternoon of unforgettable 
 music!
LOCATION:First Presbyterian Church
URL:http://www.singnapavalley.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
