SUMMARY:Cultivate Health\, Harmony  and Vitality  with Qigong
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260609T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260609T173000
UID:250831zZJ4WSfTw0Wmt6P2PtsHaw
DESCRIPTION:Awaken your energy\, calm your mind\, and reconnect with your 
 body in this healing Qigong practice that improves your health and vitalit
 y.\n\nQigong is an Ancient Chinese Health Care System that integrates brea
 th\, gently movement\, visualization and awareness to cultivate health and
