 ines. \n\nEach month we raise money for our local non-profits with a $10 d
 onation/ticket at the door – note all profits will go to this incredible
  organization in our tiny community. A great way to have fun and contribut
 e to a local cause. \n\nBarn doors open at 5 pm for the 21\\+ so there is 
 time to sip a glass of courage/wine\, belly laugh with your friends\, take
  some photos in the barn\, and catch up with friends before the dancing be
 gins at 6 pm. Be sure to wear your dancing boots and holiday hats! Giddy u
 p and join in some hometown fun!
