BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sonoma Valley Pride Weekend Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T220000
UID:260518j47p8lSa_EmY_OwxolUzmw
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma Valley Pride Weekend\n\nSonoma Valley Pride returns for
  a full weekend of queer joy\, live entertainment\, community\, and Pride 
 in the heart of Sonoma Valley.\n\nThis year’s celebration expands into a
  three-day Pride weekend\, bringing together music\, drag\, dancing\, loca
 l artists\, food\, wine\, community organizations\, and LGBTQIA+ visibilit
 y across Sonoma. Sonoma Valley Pride is focused on building queer spaces\,
  creating joyful gathering places\, and bringing more LGBTQIA+ entertainme
 nt and community-centered programming to the region.\n\nThe weekend kicks 
 off Friday\, June 12\, with **We Rise With Pride**\, Sonoma Valley Pride
 ’s first annual Concert and Drag Show at the historic Sebastiani Theatre
 . The evening features headliner **J. Graves**\, a queer\, non-binary-led 
 band from Portland known for their guitar-driven sound\, bold vocals\, and
  high-energy live performances. Blending dance-punk\, post-punk\, and gara
 ge rock influences\, J. Graves brings a sound that will appeal to fans of 
 **Yeah Yeah Yeahs** and **The Kills** — rhythmic\, electric\, and built 
 for the stage. The night also features drag from Bay Area legends **Kochin
 a Rude**\, Sonoma County native\, host\, and performer\, and **Tila Pia**\
 , an infamous stunt queen who has turned looks from Hawaii to New York.\n\
 nOn Saturday\, June 13\, the celebration continues with a Pride Dance Part
 y at **The General’s Daughter**\, inviting the community to keep the wee
 kend moving with music\, dancing\, and celebration.\n\nOn Sunday\, June 14
 \, Sonoma Valley Pride gathers on the historic Sonoma Plaza for a free com
 munity Pride Festival featuring live performances\, speakers\, queer art\,
  local vendors\, food\, wine\, and community connection. With a bigger sta
 ge\, more room to gather\, and even more ways to celebrate\, the Plaza Fes
 tival is designed for friends\, families\, chosen families\, locals\, visi
 tors\, and allies to come together in the spirit of Pride.\n\nFrom the the
 atre to the dance floor to the Plaza lawn\, Sonoma Valley Pride weekend is
  a celebration of queer artistry\, visibility\, belonging\, and joy in Son
 oma Valley. Come ready to dance\, show up\, and be part of what comes next
 .
LOCATION:Sonoma Plaza
URL:https://www.sonomavalleypride.com/?utm_source=press-democrat&utm_mediu
 m=social&utm_campaign=pride-weekend---2026-svp-pride-festival-&utm_content
 =press-dem---weekend-event-listing
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
