DESCRIPTION:Napa Pride’s beloved Pride Pet Parade & Block Pawty returns 
 on Saturday\, June 13\, for a joyful\, family-friendly celebration of pets
 \, people\, and community.\n\nDress up your furry friends and strut with P
 ride through downtown Napa. This year’s parade starts and ends at Deuces
  Market and features music\, vendors\, pet costumes\, parade fun\, and dow
 ntown block party vibes.\n\nBring your pets\, your chosen family\, your ki
 ds\, your friends\, and your Pride spirit for an afternoon celebrating LGB
 TQ+ visibility\, belonging\, and joy. Open to everyone.\n\nCome Strut & Wa
 g with us.\n\nLearn more at napapride.com.
LOCATION:Deuces Market 
URL:http://www.napapride.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
