DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260613T133000
UID:260511dqr12_ARfUejqn-KP8Y5NQ
DESCRIPTION:Heels Class — Open to All Levels\n\nStep into your confidenc
 e and learn the foundations of dancing in heels in a supportive\, no-press
 ure environment. This class is designed for beginners and anyone looking t
 o build strength\, balance\, and style from the ground up.\n\nWe’ll focu
 s on this heels class:\n\n– Walking with confidence and control\n\n– B
 asic technique\, posture\, and lines\n\n– Musicality and rhythm\n\n– S
 imple choreography to help you feel expressive and empowered\n\nExpect a f
 un\, encouraging space where you can explore your femininity\, build body 
 awareness\, and grow at your own pace. No experience needed—just bring y
 our energy and a pair of heels you feel comfortable in \\(or start in sock
 s!\\).\n\nAll levels welcome. Come as you are\n\nDATES and TIME\n\nMay 23 
 at 12:30 PM\n\nJune 13 at 12:30 PM
