 **both our Windsor and Healdsburg stores.** For just **$10 per child**\, k
 ids can enjoy a hands-on DIY experience where they’ll build seasonal pro
 jects like March’s Leprechaun Catchers\, April’s garden crafts\, and M
 ay’s handmade Mother’s Day gifts. Our team provides all the materials 
 and guidance needed\, ensuring every child leaves with a sense of pride an
 d a finished project they built themselves. It is a fantastic\, affordable
  way for kids to learn new skills while parents enjoy a stress-free mornin
 g of community and creativity.
LOCATION:Garrett Hardware
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/garrett-hardware-kid-s-
 activity-day/18163623/2026-06-13T09
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
