BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Broadway Under the Stars - Ain't Too Proud: The Life and Times of 
 the Temp.
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T220000
UID:260330D743nU23h0ajrPj6kBRbrQ
DESCRIPTION:Ain’t Too Proud is the Tony-winning\, electrifying musical 
 that follows The Temptations’ extraordinary journey from the streets of 
 Detroit to the Rock & Roll Hall of Fame. Featuring their signature dance m
 oves and unforgettable harmonies\, this musical takes audiences behind the
  music: how the group formed\, the unprecedented chart-topping success the
 y achieved \\(42 Top Ten hits\, 14 \\#1 singles\\)\, and the personal and 
 political tensions that threatened their unity during a turbulent era in A
 merica.\n\nThis thrilling story of brotherhood\, family loyalty and betray
 al is set to the beat of the group’s treasured hits\, including “My Gi
 rl\,” “Just My Imagination\,” “Get Ready\,” “Papa Was a Rollin
 g Stone” and so many more\, with a book by award-winning playwright Domi
 nique Morisseau \\(Skeleton Crew\, Paradise Blue\\) adapted from Williams
 ’s 1988 memoir. The New York Times praised the show as\, “Pretty clos
 e to perfect”\, with The Washington Post proclaiming it was “Dazzling 
 and Electrifying.”\n\nAin’t Too Proud is presented through special ar
 rangement with Music Theatre International \\(MTI\\). All authorized perfo
 rmance materials are also supplied by MTI. www.mtishows.com\n\nMusic Thea
 tre International gives Ain’t Too Proud: The Life and Times of the Tempt
 ations a PG13 rating. This production is a gritty\, authentic look at the
  history of The Temptations. Parental discretion is advised.
LOCATION:Sonoma Field of Dreams
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/broadway-under-the-star
 s-ain-t-too-proud-the-life-and-times-of-the-temp/18460828/2026-06-14T19
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Novato Art\, Wine & Music Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T180000
UID:260328HW4aYcYkBUOH849b6IVHDQ
DESCRIPTION:Get Ready for the Ultimate Summer Kickoff!\n\nFor more than fo
 ur decades\, the Novato Art\, Wine & Music Festival has been a vibrant cel
 ebration of creativity\, community\, and good vibes! Mark your calendar fo
 r Saturday & Sunday\, June 13–14\, 2026\, and join us for a weekend pack
 ed with live music\, amazing local art\, fantastic food\, and plenty of wi
 ne and craft beer—all in the heart of Novato.\n\nWhat’s in Store? Live
  Music Galore – Our Main Stage will be rocking with top-tier performance
 s\, including crowd favorites and high-energy tribute bands\, plus an exci
 ting lineup of regional talent. You’ll also find live music throughout t
 he festival along Grant Avenue\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a sum
 mer weekend.\n\nSavor & Sip – Sample a wide selection of premium wines\,
  craft brews\, and refreshing margaritas. Be sure to grab a commemorative 
 beer & wine glass to celebrate the weekend in style.\n\nA Foodie’s Parad
 ise – Treat your taste buds to a delicious spread\, from teriyaki chicke
 n kebabs\, crab fries\, and lobster rolls to gourmet chicken wings\, snow 
 cones\, kettle corn\, and more. There’s something for every craving!\n\n
 Art & Shopping – Stroll through unique vendor booths showcasing fine hom
 e décor\, sculptures\, paintings\, photography\, handcrafted jewelry\, ar
 tisan goods\, and specialty items. Discover one-of-a-kind treasures while 
 supporting talented artists and makers.\n\nFun for the Kids! – The child
 ren’s area will feature interactive activities\, bounce attractions\, fa
 ce painting\, games\, and hands-on creative experiences— making it fun f
 or the whole family.\n\nWHEN & WHERE: Saturday\, June 13 \\(11 a.m. – 7 
 p.m.\\) & Sunday\, June 14 \\(11 a.m. – 6 p.m.\\)\n\nDowntown Novato –
  Grant Avenue\n\nFREE ADMISSION! For more details\, visit: www.novatochamb
 er.com Follow along on social media for updates and entertainment announce
 ments.\n\nKick off your summer the right way—see you at the festival! 
 🎶�
LOCATION:Downtown- Grant Ave
URL:http://novatochamber.com/2025-art-wine-mu sic
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
